# Glorious End cast in Bot1's own end step: that end step has already begun, so "your next end step" is the one of Bot1's
# next turn (CR 603.7, 513). The turn ends at once (CR 724.1); Bot1 is still in the game through turn 2 and turn 3's second
# main phase, and loses as turn 3's end step begins.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Glorious End
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glorious End.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Result = InProgress
? Exile = Glorious End
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Result = InProgress
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Status = Lost
